# {{.ProjectName}}

Go API with Chi router and Hexagonal Architecture.

## Requirements

- Go 1.22+

## Run

```bash
go mod tidy
go run ./cmd/api
```

## Structure

```
├── cmd/api/               # Entry point and dependency wiring
├── internal/
│   ├── domain/            # Pure domain entities
│   ├── item/              # Item module (ports, service, handler)
│   └── platform/          # Infrastructure layer (database, etc.)
└── pkg/meta/              # Pagination helper
```

## Endpoints

- `POST /items`       — Create an item
- `GET  /items/{id}`  — Get item by ID
